+/// SimForge patch: a per-view multiplier on the distance a view measures to
+/// entities with [`VisibilityRange`]s. An entity is in range of a view when
+/// `distance * scale` lies in its range, so one set of ranges serves views of
+/// different focal lengths, each selecting exactly as its own ranges would.
+/// A view without the component measures plain distance (scale 1).
+#[derive(Component, Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Reflect)]
+#[reflect(Component, Debug, PartialEq, Clone)]
+pub struct VisibilityRangeScale(pub f32);
+
